     3	/**
     4	 * A membership account. Member numbers are opaque strings: store-card members
     5	 * carry the 6-digit number printed on the card,
     6	 * app members have shorter app-issued numbers, corporate members a C-code.
     7	 */
     8	public record Member(String memberNo, String name, Grade grade, String channel) {}

